The template engine has never been released for Apache POI 4 or later: the published
com.coreoz:ppt-templates:1.0.1 is compiled against org.apache.poi.POIXMLDocumentPart, which POI 4
moved to org.apache.poi.ooxml.POIXMLDocumentPart. The POI 5 compatible sources of the master branch
are therefore vendored into this project, in spring-powerpoint-core:

    src/main/java/com/coreoz/ppt/*.java                      (12 files)
    src/main/java/org/apache/poi/ooxml/PptPoiBridge.java

Origin: branch master, commit fb8b7386a9ad7dce9e139f4a6839c3037a142803 (2024-09).

Changes made to the vendored files:

  * Lombok annotations (@Value, @AllArgsConstructor, @SneakyThrows) replaced by plain Java:
    explicit constructors, static of(...) factory methods, getters, and try/catch blocks wrapping
    IOException into UncheckedIOException. The public shape of every class is unchanged.
  * The @Deprecated annotation of PptPoiBridge was removed: it only discourages external use, which
    its JavaDoc states as well, and it made every internal call site emit a warning.

PptPoiBridge stays in the org.apache.poi.ooxml package, as upstream: it calls
POIXMLDocumentPart.removeRelation, which is protected. This works on the class path but not with the
Java Platform Module System.

